## Testing:
- Manual API testing performed using Postman / Thunder Client.
- Authentication routes tested.
- Public and protected API routes tested.
- Invalid input handling tested.
- Basic security testing performed for unauthorized access, fake tokens, XSS-style input, SQL injection-style input, and rate limiting.
